    "description": "Nestled in San Francisco's desirable Inner Richmond, this updated duplex blends comfort, versatility, and classic charmideal for homeowners or investors. The upper unit features new flooring and carpet, stylish lighting, and an open-concept layout connecting the living and dining areas. A refreshed kitchen with quartz countertops and modern finishes makes cooking and entertaining a joy. Down the hall are two serene bedrooms, including a spacious primary suite with a private half bath, while the third bedroom at the front of the home provides flexibility for guests or a home office.    The lower unit offers two generous size bedrooms, an updated bath with double vanity, and bright living and dining spaces highlighted by refinished hardwood floors and period trim. Perfect for multi-generational living or rental income, both units combine comfort and functionality.    An expansive garage provides parking, laundry, and storage, with a bonus area ready for a studio or recreation room. Sliding doors open to a backyard awaiting your touchgarden, patio, or outdoor kitchen. Located minutes from Target, Trader Joe's, cafs, and parks, with easy access to Golden Gate Park, the Presidio, and city transit, this duplex offers San Francisco living at its best."
  },
